  "description": "Ride Farther. Ride Faster. Ride Smarter.\n\nThe PASELEC TX01 combines power, comfort, and versatility for daily commuting and weekend adventures. Equipped with a powerful 1000W peak motor, long-range removable battery, and 29-inch all-terrain tires, the TX01 delivers a smooth and reliable riding experience on city streets, bike paths, and light off-road terrain.\n\n⚡ 1000W Peak Brushless Motor\n\nExperience strong acceleration and responsive power with a 1000W peak rear hub motor.\n\n🔋 48V 16Ah Removable Battery\n\nThe integrated removable battery offers dependable range for everyday travel.\n\n🚴 29\" All-Terrain Tires\n\nDesigned to handle multiple road conditions while maintaining speed and comfort.\n\nThe large 29-inch wheels provide improved stability and smoother rolling performance.\n\n🛞 Front Suspension Fork\n\nThe front suspension system absorbs bumps and vibrations, helping reduce rider fatigue on uneven roads.\n\n⚙️ 7-Speed Shimano Gear System\n\nShift smoothly through different riding conditions with the reliable 7-speed drivetrain.\n\n🛑 Dual Mechanical Disc Brakes\n\nRide confidently with responsive braking performance.\n\n💡 Built for Everyday Convenience\n\nMonitor speed, battery level, and riding information at a glance while staying visible during night rides.\n\n📏 Rider Fit & Capacity\n\nWhat's Included\n\nPASELEC TX01 Electric Bike\n\n48V 16Ah Battery\n\nBattery Charger\n\nFront Headlight\n\nRear Cargo Rack\n\nUser Manual\n\nAssembly Tools",
